{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WNKjxpxDA2T3xcumftT36J","type":"tool_result","content":"1951 PLAN.md\n1:# Densha de Halo!\n22:## 0. How to use this plan\n45:## 1. The game on one page\n112:## 2. Controls (final mapping)\n145:## 3. Architecture\n147:### 3.1 Stack and why\n162:### 3.2 Dev folder layout\n206:### 3.3 Scenes and flow\n231:### 3.4 Per-step order in `drive` (fixed 1/120 s steps)\n258:### 3.5 Units and coordinates\n270:### 3.6 Determinism and randomness\n281:### 3.7 `game.debug` handle (tests, tools/check.mjs, tools/replay.mjs)\n301:### 3.8 Engine changes (keep minimal; log each in `ENGINE-CHANGES.md`)\n327:## 4. Systems\n331:### 4.1 Rail renderer (`DH.Rail`, module `rail.js`): the riskiest piece, so build it first\n451:### 4.2 Route data and compiler (`20-routes.js`, `21-route-compiler.js`)\n497:### 4.3 Train dynamics and the lever (`30-train.js`)\n545:### 4.4 Signals, blocks, other trains, ATS (`31-signals.js`)\n594:### 4.5 Speed limits (`33-rules.js`)\n605:### 4.6 Stations: approach, stop, judgment, dwell, departure (`32-stations.js`)\n664:### 4.7 Point and call (*shisa kanko*) and the horn (`33-rules.js`)\n706:### 4.8 Timetable and clock (`32-stations.js`)\n719:### 4.9 Halo Time, score, ranks (`33-rules.js`)\n762:### 4.10 Passengers, crowds and comfort (`33-rules.js`, `art-people.js`)\n786:### 4.11 Events (`34-events.js`)\n809:### 4.12 Time of day, weather and light (`40-sound.js` for audio, `rail.js` for the image)\n833:### 4.13 Cameras and the director (`60-drive.js`, `61-attract.js`)\n858:### 4.14 Cab, HUD, stop gauge (`50-cab.js`, `51-hud.js`)\n905:### 4.15 Input, devices, glyphs, touch-only (`00-core.js`, `05-glyphs.js`)\n944:### 4.16 Sound: soundscape, sfx, melodies, music (`40-sound.js`)\n1001:### 4.17 Voices: Babble, gibberish in the Animalese/Simlish style (`41-babble.js`)\n1034:### 4.18 Story, dialogue, subtitles, tips (`52-story.js`)\n1050:### 4.19 Autopilot (`35-autopilot.js`): used by attract, Dev auto-drive, tests and calibration\n1094:### 4.20 Attract mode (`61-attract.js`)\n1124:### 4.21 Dev Mode (`62-dev.js`)\n1180:### 4.22 Progress, Driver's Log, postcards (`55-ui-log.js`)\n1205:### 4.23 Multiplayer A: AI Hub session, **ghost** mode (`63-hub.js`)\n1272:### 4.24 Multiplayer B: local Duel, split screen (`64-duel.js`)\n1286:### 4.25 Settings, accessibility, difficulty\n1309:### 4.26 Front-end screens (`55-ui-*.js`): big, few items, pixel-art, controller-first\n1354:## 5. Content\n1356:### 5.1 Akari City and the Halo Line\n1410:### 5.2 Trains\n1422:### 5.3 Stages\n1571:### 5.4 Characters (Humanoid rigs for portraits and on-world figures; Blob for the mascot)\n1586:### 5.5 Writing style guide and script\n1681:### 5.6 Art assets\n1708:### 5.7 Animations (new, on top of the engine's rigs)\n1723:### 5.8 Audio assets\n1744:## 6. Build order and milestones\n1767:## 7. Risks and how to de-risk them\n1794:## 8. Testing\n1796:### 8.1 One command\n1812:### 8.2 Headless suites (what each asserts)\n1844:### 8.3 Browser checks (`--browser`; Playwright 1.63.0, file:// first)\n1856:### 8.4 AI Hub harness (`--hub`)\n1869:### 8.5 Screenshots (only for what scripts can't judge)\n1894:## 9. Ship checklist","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ed18f8de-7c3c-4ed5-a440-ff3ec45bd88d","uuid":"7b1bc9c3-387a-4c1e-a6be-7273266cd31d","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:02:58.878Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"1951 PLAN.md\n1:# Densha de Halo!\n22:## 0. How to use this plan\n45:## 1. The game on one page\n112:## 2. Controls (final mapping)\n145:## 3. Architecture\n147:### 3.1 Stack and why\n162:### 3.2 Dev folder layout\n206:### 3.3 Scenes and flow\n231:### 3.4 Per-step order in `drive` (fixed 1/120 s steps)\n258:### 3.5 Units and coordinates\n270:### 3.6 Determinism and randomness\n281:### 3.7 `game.debug` handle (tests, tools/check.mjs, tools/replay.mjs)\n301:### 3.8 Engine changes (keep minimal; log each in `ENGINE-CHANGES.md`)\n327:## 4. Systems\n331:### 4.1 Rail rende