{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghtSXiaXXv4fqMNAu4Ur","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0163CGMWr4YR8ysQWQ2HidRY","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='src/35-autopilot.js'; s=open(p).read()\na=\"(T.v < 4 && n <= -2 ? 0.5 : 0);\"\nassert s.count(a)==1\ns=s.replace(a,\"(T.v < 4 && n <= -2 ? 0.06 : 0);\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/31-sim.js'; s=open(p).read()\na=s[s.index(\"  maxPoints() {\"):s.index(\"  rankOf(total) {\")]\nb='''  maxPoints() {\n    const first = this.stage.startStopped ? 1 : 0;\n    const judged = this.stops.slice(first).length;\n    const arrivals = this.stops.slice(first).filter(x => x.arrival !== null).length;\n    const calls = this.calls.filter(c => c.s >= this.stageSpan[0] && c.s <= this.stageSpan[1]).length;\n    const horns = this.route.horns.filter(h => h.s >= this.stageSpan[0] && h.s <= this.stageSpan[1]).length;\n    const maxHalo = this.haloStart + judged * 5 + arrivals * 3 + judged * 2 + horns * 1 + calls * 0.5;\n    return judged * 1000 + arrivals * (500 + 300) + calls * 100 + horns * 100 + (this.stage.obstruction ? 800 : 0) + maxHalo * 50 + 100 * 5;\n  }\n'''\ns=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat > NOTES.md <<'EOF'\n# Densha de Halo! — build notes (dev folder)\n\nTitle: Densha de Halo! (GameTitle DenshaDeHalo, SOURCE DenshaDeGo). Plan: ../PLAN.md. Spec: ../TASK.md.\n\n## Layout (so far)\n- engine/ — copy of my-3D2dge v0.85.2 handoff (unmodified so far; ENGINE-CHANGES.md not yet written).\n- _src/engine, _src/ai-hub/lib/hub — clones used for reference (delete before finishing).\n- src/00-core.js — DH namespace, RNG, colour, TUNING sliders (defaults + ranges), TRAINS.\n- src/10-rail.js — DH.Rail renderer (segments, strips, things, tint/fog/grade, crest, project/pick). DH.buildScenery.\n- src/21-route-compiler.js — ROUTES (halo: -300..20700, depot 0..1000), compileRoute, validateRoute, ZONES.\n- src/22-stages.js — STAGES: S0 (depot, lessons, frozen halo), S1..S5, PR.\n- src/30-train.js — Train physics (plan 4.3). Check values pass (test/.scratch/physics.cjs).\n- src/31-sim.js — Sim: signals/blocks/aspects, ATS, limits, stops/judgments/dwell, halo, score, comfort, calls, horn, crossings, obstruction, events, snapshot().\n- src/35-autopilot.js — Auto: MPC-style stop (predict()), cruise with limits/aspect caps, calls, horn, ATS, departure.\n- test/.scratch/*.cjs — scratch probes (play.cjs = full autopilot run of a stage; trace.cjs; final.cjs; physics.cjs).\n\n## Status\n- Route compiles and validates. Physics check values match the plan.\n- Autopilot completes S1 end to end: stops within 0.05 m with PERFECT when not smoothing; SMOOTH works; ATS works.\n- Not yet: S2..S5/PR playthrough check, timetable calibration, UI/scenes, audio, dev mode, attract, hub, duel, tests, bundle, About text, exit-interview.\n\n## Known issues / next\n- Timetables are uncalibrated (LATE +3 on S1). Calibrate with autopilot minTime par (plan 4.8).\n- Stage-level checks for S2 freight, S3 obstruction, S4 rival, S5 fog/flash not yet run.\nEOF\n(timeout 900 node test/.scratch/play.cjs S2 1 > test/.scratch/s2.out 2>&1; echo DONE >> test/.scratch/s2.out) & (timeout 900 node test/.scratch/play.cjs S3 1 > test/.scratch/s3.out 2>&1; echo DONE >> test/.scratch/s3.out) & sleep 100; for f in s2 s3; do echo \"== $f\"; grep -v \"call \\|CALL\" test/.scratch/$f.out | head -30; done","description":"Adjust scoring max and smooth bias; run S2 and S3 autopilot"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4956,"cache_read_input_tokens":361714,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4956},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"se