{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Qr5wRYsQsj8TeN2vBt6Rtp","type":"tool_result","content":"183:- `E.store`: saved data that survives reloads (localStorage, JSON). Never throws.\n184:- `E.store.get(key, fallback = null)`: the value saved under key (any JSON), or fallback\n185:- `E.store.remove(key)`: forget key\n186:- `E.store.set(key, value)`: save value (any JSON) under key; false when storage is blocked\n567:- `settings.reset(group)`: put a group's settings (or all of them) back to their defaults; a game's saves are not touched\n183:- `E.store`: saved data that survives reloads (localStorage, JSON). Never throws.\n184:- `E.store.get(key, fallback = null)`: the value saved under key (any JSON), or fallback\n185:- `E.store.remove(key)`: forget key\n186:- `E.store.set(key, value)`: save value (any JSON) under key; false when storage is blocked\n622:- `saves.get(slot)` †: a slot's save as it is stored, checked: null when empty; { slot, damaged: true } when it can't be read; { newer: true } from a newer version of the game; else { slot, data, place, level, time, at (the date saved), version }\n869:- `level.cells`: stored bottom row first: cz = 0 is the lowest row and z grows upward\n1095:- `E.addAssets(set)`: register a store set (src/assets/sets/*.js: { set, format: 1, credit, sources, materials, shapes, sprites }): its entries are named 'SET:id' (so one set never changes another's, or the core's) and find their own set's materials and shapes first. An id that is already there warns and keeps the first. Returns { shapes: [ids], materials: [ids], sprites: { id: sprite } } (sprites are E.sprite data; a color may be 'material:tone', tone deep | sh | base | lt | hi)\n1163:- `new E.Shell(game, o = {}) → shell`: new E.Shell(game, { theme, screens: { name: spec }, settings: { items, onChange(settings, key) }, store: 'shell-settings', meters: .125, standard: true }): an HTML interface over the game (see the section's header)\n1167:- `new E.Shell({ store, meters })`: store: where an older version saved them; meters: meters per world unit for distances\n1266:- `click.restore(s)` †: put back what state() gave\n1601:- `world.load()`: go back to the save (its room entered, what was got and seen restored): { room, x, z, got, seen, extra }, or null\n1631:- `rpg.restore(s)`: the party a save held (party.state())\n1654:- `story.restore(s)`: put back what state() gave (a load)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ed18f8de-7c3c-4ed5-a440-ff3ec45bd88d","uuid":"a00e6e3b-eeda-47c7-bf53-f8941ab17dde","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:33:23.776Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"183:- `E.store`: saved data that survives reloads (localStorage, JSON). Never throws.\n184:- `E.store.get(key, fallback = null)`: the value saved under key (any JSON), or fallback\n185:- `E.store.remove(key)`: forget key\n186:- `E.store.set(key, value)`: save value (any JSON) under key; false when storage is blocked\n567:- `settings.reset(group)`: put a group's settings (or all of them) back to their defaults; a game's saves are not touched\n183:- `E.store`: saved data that survives reloads (localStorage, JSON). Never throws.\n184:- `E.store.get(key, fallback = null)`: the value saved under key (any JSON), or fallback\n185:- `E.store.remove(key)`: forget key\n186:- `E.store.set(key, value)`: save value (any JSON) under key; false when storage is blocked\n622:- `saves.get(slot)` †: a slot's save as it is stored, checked: null when empty; { slot, damaged: true } when it can't be read; { newer: true } from a newer version of the game; else { slot, data, place, level, time, at (the date saved), version }\n869:- `level.cells`: stored bottom row first: cz = 0 is the lowest row and z grows upward\n1095:- `E.addAssets(set)`: register a store set (src/assets/sets/*.js: { set, format: 1, credit, sources, materials, shapes, sprites }): its entries are named 'SET:id' (so one set never changes another's, or the core's) and find their own set's materials and shapes first. An id that is already there warns and keeps the first. Returns { shapes: [ids], materials: [ids], sprites: { id: sprite } } (sprites are E.sprite data; a color may be 'material:tone', tone deep | sh | base | lt | hi)\n1163:- `new E.Shell(game, o = {}) → shell`: new E.Shell(game, { theme, screens: { name: spec }, settings: { items, onChange(settings, key) }, store: 'shell-settings', meters: .125, standard: true }): an HTML interface over the game (see the section's header)\n1167:- `new E.Shell({ store, meters })`: store: where an older version saved them; meters: meters per world unit for distances\n1266:- `click.restore(s)` †: put back what state() gave\n1601:- `world.load()`: go back to the save (its room entered, what was got and seen restored): { room, x, z, got, seen, extra }, or null\n1631:- `rpg.restore(s)`: the party a save held (party.state())\n1654:- `story.restore(s)`: put back what state() gave (a load)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Qr5wRYsQsj8TeN2vBt6Rtp","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghtqS7dBLgwtrKrs4rb4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01W3mqgSLAFBzzzTzxUwGxbu","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"grep -n \"E.Menu\\|class Menu\\|E.Dialog\\|  say(\\|talk.say\\|  pick(\\|  update(dt)\\|  draw(r)\" API.md | head -20; grep -n \"^- \\`new E.Menu\\|E.Menu\\b\" API-INDEX.md | head -5; grep -n \"audio.ctx\\|  ctx\\b\\|sfx(\" API-INDEX.md | head -10; grep -n \"game.menu\\|menu(name\\|  menu(\" API-INDEX.md | head -5; grep -n \"glyphs\" API-INDEX.md | head -5","description":"Find Menu, Dialog, audio and glyph API entries"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3633,"cache_read_input_tokens":388242,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3633},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ed18f8de-7c3c-4ed5-a440-ff3ec45bd88d","uuid":"58d127a6-357d-4b34-a6df-88ce010811dd","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:33:27.152Z","request_id":"req_011CghtqRo2i6sDYq581vCDh","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01W3mqgSLAFBzzzTzxUwGxbu":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050241__xd92716/work/DenshaDeHalo-DenshaDeGo-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-050241/engine && grep -n \"E.Menu\\|class Menu\\|E.Dialog\\|  say(\\|talk.say\\|  pick(\\|  update(dt)\\|  draw(r)\" API.md | head -20; grep -n \"^- \\`new E.Menu\\|E.Menu\\b\" API-INDEX.md | head -5; grep -n \"audio.ctx\\|  ctx\\b\\|sfx(\" API-INDEX.md | head -10; grep -n \"game.menu\\|menu(name\\|  menu(\" API-INDEX.md | head -5; grep -n \"glyphs\" API-INDEX.md | head -5","description":"Find Menu, Dialog, audio and glyph API entries"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01W